ise and ketchup condiments; and Unilever food solutions. The company provides its products under the AXE, Clear, Cif, Closeup, Comfort, Dermalogica, Domestos, Dove, Dove Men+Care, Hellmann's, Horlicks, Knorr, LUX, Lifebuoy, Liquid I.V., Nexxus, Nutrafol, OMO, Pond's, Paula's Choice, Pepsodent, Radiant, Rexona, Sunlight, Sunsilk, Surf, TRESemmé, and Vaseline brand names. Unilever PLC was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","fullTimeEmployees":93731,"city":"London","country":"United Kingdom","website":"https://www.unilever.com","industry":"Household & Personal Products","sector":"Consumer Defensive"},"news":[{"title":"Pressure Across Staples. Why Deutsche Bank Still Upgraded Unilever (UL)","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/pressure-across-staples-why-deutsche-211329314.html","publisher":"Insider Monkey","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Shuffle Board: Capri Names Justin Boxford CEO","link":"https://wwd.com/sourcing-journal/industry-news/shuffle-board-capri-justin-boxford-tods-lim-college-1239415542/","publisher":"Sourcing Journal","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"European Equities Traded in the US as American Depositary Receipts Rise Marginally in Friday Trading","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/european-equities-traded-us-american-161727720.html","publisher":"MT Newswires","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Unilever (LSE:ULVR) Stock Looks Fairly Valued On Future Cash Flow","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/unilever-lse-ulvr-stock-looks-021529565.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Unilever (LSE:ULVR) Faces A Valuation Test After Its Leadership Reset","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/unilever-lse-ulvr-faces-valuation-232243554.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"How Unilever’s social-first marketing is evolving amid reorganization","link":"https://www.marketingdive.com/news/how-unilevers-social-first-marketing-is-evolving-amid-reorganization/874457/","publisher":"Marketing Dive","date":"2026-11-12"}],"info_date":"2026-11-14"}